# 🛰️ HOPPER AGENT RULES

Always follow the instructions in `@.hopper/ACTIVE_GOAL.md`.
If the file says 'No active goals,' do not perform any work. Wait for the user to release a goal in the Hopper UI.

## COMPLETION PROTOCOL
When you finish a task, you MUST run the completion command found at the bottom of `ACTIVE_GOAL.md`.
Always include a brief summary of your work in the 'message' field of the JSON body.
